                                "sense_id": "0e5483d4-cb6d-3836-ad15-851041b9e242",
                                "text": "We are shown the fine Turkey-cup or Levantine sponges, the African Zimoccas, the West-Indian grass-sponges and wire-sponges, the great elephants' ears from the Philippines, and many more […]"
